                        en: "Water resources are essential for power generation and the livelihood of surrounding communities. Risks in water resources are related to climate change and can lead to water shortages in the areas affected by the changing climate. Therefore, the Company regularly assesses water resource risk, particularly in water-stressed areas. Water management focuses on recycling as much water as possible to minimize water consumption and water discharge to comply with water quality standards. Details are as follows:",
