                        en: "Banpu Power's power generation and energy businesses rely mainly on fuels in their production processes. So, the Company aims to reduce Scope 1 emissions by reducing fuel consumption. It also seeks opportunities to reduce GHG emissions by improving energy efficiency, reducing energy loss in production, conducting studies on alternative fuels, and investing in low-carbon businesses to achieve the GHG emissions target. In addition, the Company has considered internal carbon pricing when making investment decisions in any projects. The Company also established the climate-related task forces in collaboration with Banpu Group. BPP also adopts various management approaches for greenhouse gas emissions reduction across its different business operations as follows:",
